@title Demonstrable Harm Reduction (tikkun olam): Go Past Not Harming
@audience War Machine authors and reviewers, mission owners
@tone measured
@style pattern
@tier optative
@references ["militant-pacifism/precept-of-non-harm (the floor)" "militant-pacifism/world-to-come-in-the-present (why the aim shapes the act)" "liberation/mundane/right-effort (develop and maintain the wholesome)"]
@status DRAFT 2026-11-05, not approved

! conclusion: Work should actively reduce stress, tension and tendencies to violence, and should say how that reduction would be observed; this is a "should", checked softly, not a gate.

  + context: The war-room's stated purpose (Dhammapada 5, 197, 201; War Resisters International) is not only to avoid war but to "strive for the removal of all causes of war". Tikkun olam names the same move: from mishnaic enactments made "for the repair of the world" (Mishnah Gittin 4) to later readings as a duty to repair. Gandhi interpreted ahimsa similarly, moving from a vow of restraint to active nonviolent work.

  + IF:
    A system only checks the precept, it can satisfy every rule while doing nothing that makes anything better, and "harmless" becomes the goal.

  + HOWEVER:
    "Reduces harm" is easy to assert and hard to show. A mandatory harm-reduction field would fill with boilerplate, and a hard gate on it would block useful work whose benefit is indirect.

  + THEN:
    Ask each deliverable for an optional, specific claim: whose stress or which tension it reduces, and what observation would show it (fewer conflicting writes, a question that stops recurring, an operator turn that no longer has to be repeated). Record the claim with the deliverable; review it later against what was observed. An absent claim is not a failure; a claim that observation contradicts is worth surfacing.

  + BECAUSE:
    The aim only changes behaviour if it is stated where the work is judged, and it only stays honest if it can be contradicted.

  + NEXT-STEPS:
    - Find one existing WM deliverable where a harm-reduction claim could be written and later checked.
    - Do not score or rank on this field until there are observations to score against.
